@startuml DQIMS_Activity_Root_Cause_Analysis
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

title <size:16><b>DQIMS - Root Cause Analysis Activity Diagram</b></size>\n<size:12>5 Whys Method with HOD Approval Workflow</size>\n

|#FCE4EC|Assigned Member|
start
:Receive Issue Assignment;

:Investigate Issue;

:Gather Information:
- Review issue details
- Check related data
- Interview stakeholders
- Analyze patterns;

:Navigate to Issue Detail Page;

:Click "Create Root Cause Analysis";

:Select Analysis Method;
note right: 5 Whys or Fishbone

if (Method Selected?) then (5 WHYS)
  
  :Fill 5 Whys Form:
  
  **Why 1:** Why did the issue occur?
  → [Answer 1]
  
  **Why 2:** Why did [Answer 1] happen?
  → [Answer 2]
  
  **Why 3:** Why did [Answer 2] happen?
  → [Answer 3]
  
  **Why 4:** Why did [Answer 3] happen?
  → [Answer 4]
  
  **Why 5:** Why did [Answer 4] happen?
  → [Answer 5] = ROOT CAUSE;
  
else (FISHBONE)
  
  :Fill Fishbone Analysis:
  
  **People Factors:**
  - Training gaps
  - Knowledge issues
  
  **Process Factors:**
  - Procedure problems
  - Workflow issues
  
  **Technology Factors:**
  - System bugs
  - Integration errors
  
  **Environment Factors:**
  - Time pressure
  - Resource constraints
  
  **Material Factors:**
  - Data quality
  - Source issues
  
  **Measurement Factors:**
  - Missing metrics
  - Poor monitoring;
  
endif

:Identify Root Cause;

:Document Corrective Actions:
"What to do NOW to fix this issue";

:Document Preventive Actions:
"What to do to PREVENT future issues";

:Add Supporting Evidence/Attachments;

:Save as DRAFT;

|#E3F2FD|System|
:Create RCA Record:
- issue_id
- analysis_method
- why_1 to why_5 (or fishbone factors)
- root_cause
- corrective_actions
- preventive_actions
- analyzed_by = current user
- status = DRAFT
- created_at = now;

:Save to database;

:Return Success;

|Assigned Member|
:Review RCA Draft;

if (Ready to Submit?) then (no)
  :Edit and Refine Analysis;
  :Update RCA;
  |System|
  :Save Changes;
  |Assigned Member|
else (yes)
endif

:Click "Submit for Review" Button;

|System|
:Validate RCA Completeness;

if (All Required Fields Filled?) then (no)
  :Return Error: Incomplete RCA;
  |Assigned Member|
  stop
else (yes)
endif

:Update RCA Status = PENDING_REVIEW;

:Set analyzed_at = now;

:Create Audit Log Entry;

|#FFF3E0|Notification Service|
fork
  :Create Notification for HOD;
fork again
  :Send Email to HOD:
  "RCA submitted for review
  Issue: ISS-XXXX-YYYY";
end fork

|System|
:Return Success;

|Assigned Member|
:Display: "RCA Submitted for Review";

:Wait for HOD Response;

' ========== HOD REVIEW ==========

|#E8F5E9|HOD (Head of Department)|
:Receive Notification;

:Navigate to Issue Detail Page;

:Click "View RCA" Tab;

:Review Root Cause Analysis:
- Read all Why questions
- Verify root cause makes sense
- Check corrective actions are specific
- Check preventive actions are comprehensive;

:Evaluate Quality of Analysis;

if (RCA Quality Acceptable?) then (yes)
  
  :Click "Approve" Button;
  
  :Add Approval Comments (optional);
  
  :Click "Confirm Approval";
  
  |System|
  :Update RCA:
  - status = APPROVED
  - reviewed_by = HOD
  - reviewed_at = now;
  
  :Update Related Issue:
  - Add preventive actions to notes
  - Update tags;
  
  :Create Issue History Entry:
  "RCA approved by [HOD Name]";
  
  :Create Audit Log Entry;
  
  |Notification Service|
  fork
    :Notify Analyst: "RCA Approved";
  fork again
    :Notify Department Team:
    "Preventive actions identified";
  end fork
  
  |System|
  :Return Success;
  
  |HOD (Head of Department)|
  :Display: "RCA Approved Successfully";
  
  |Assigned Member|
  :Receive Approval Notification;
  
  :Implement Preventive Actions;
  
  :Update Issue Status;
  
  :Close Issue;
  
else (no)
  
  :Click "Reject" Button;
  
  :Enter Rejection Reason:
  - What's missing?
  - What needs improvement?
  - Specific feedback;
  
  :Click "Confirm Rejection";
  
  |System|
  :Update RCA:
  - status = REJECTED
  - reviewed_by = HOD
  - reviewed_at = now
  - rejection_reason;
  
  :Create Audit Log Entry;
  
  |Notification Service|
  fork
    :Notify Analyst: "RCA Rejected";
  fork again
    :Send Email with Feedback;
  end fork
  
  |System|
  :Return Success;
  
  |HOD (Head of Department)|
  :Display: "RCA Rejected. Feedback Sent.";
  
  |Assigned Member|
  :Receive Rejection Notification;
  
  :Read HOD Feedback;
  
  :Revise RCA;
  
  :Update Analysis:
  - Address feedback
  - Strengthen analysis
  - Add more details;
  
  |System|
  :Update RCA Record;
  
  :Keep status = DRAFT or REJECTED;
  
  |Assigned Member|
  :Submit Again for Review;
  
  |System|
  :Set status = PENDING_REVIEW;
  
  :Notify HOD Again;
  
  |HOD (Head of Department)|
  :Review Updated RCA;
  
  note right
    Cycle repeats until approved
  end note
  
endif

stop

legend right
  <b>RCA Workflow States:</b>
  
  <b>DRAFT</b>
  • Analyst is working on RCA
  • Can edit freely
  • Not yet submitted
  
  <b>PENDING_REVIEW</b>
  • Submitted to HOD
  • Waiting for approval
  • Cannot edit
  
  <b>APPROVED</b>
  • HOD approved
  • Preventive actions accepted
  • Ready for implementation
  
  <b>REJECTED</b>
  • HOD rejected with feedback
  • Needs revision
  • Can edit and resubmit
  
  <b>Analysis Methods:</b>
  
  <b>5 Whys:</b>
  Ask "why" 5 times to dig
  deeper to root cause
  
  <b>Fishbone (6M):</b>
  • Man (People)
  • Machine (Technology)
  • Method (Process)
  • Mother Nature (Environment)
  • Material (Data/Materials)
  • Measurement (Metrics)
  
  <b>Key Benefits:</b>
  • Prevents recurrence
  • Documents lessons learned
  • Improves processes
  • Knowledge sharing
endlegend

@enduml
